error[result-no-success-value]: `result` can reach the end of its body without a success value
  --> src/jobs.tt:7:23
   |
 7 |   export const queued = result {
   |  _______________________^
 8 | |   const job = try fetchJob();
 9 | |   persist(job);
10 | | };
   | |_^
   |
   = help: return a value from every reachable path in this `result` block
error[result-value-discarded]: `result` is used as a statement, so its `Err` would be discarded
  --> src/jobs.tt:13:3
   |
13 |     result {
   |  ___^
14 | |     const job = try fetchJob();
15 | |     return job.id;
16 | |   };
