error[try-placement]: `try` cannot be used in a constructor or generator — its `Err` propagation requires an ordinary function return
  --> src/jobs.tt:21:17
   |
21 |     const job = try fetchJob();
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: move the propagation into an ordinary function, or handle the Result explicitly
